zemail␀Prepare Domo for walthrough session␀As part of the enhancement of the Hostel Module, I was assigned the task to develop a Student Preference Page on the student portal. This page allows students to submit their preferences for: 

1: Hostel Buildings (e.g., Building A, B, C, etc.) 

2: Room Categories (e.g., Single, Double, AC, Non-AC, etc.) 

The main objectives of the task were: 
To design a user-friendly UI where students can rank their preferences for available hostel buildings. 
To allow students to select their preferred room categories and rank them accordingly. 
To ensure validation so that each preference is unique and properly prioritized. 
To capture and store these preferences in the backend for further processing during hostel allotment. 
To integrate the preference page into the existing student dashboard within the hostel module.␀B&R Email Formats SD and FI Invoices close Observations 
