Implemented a new search page to provide a graphical representation of hostel room details.
2.	Admission Module - Report Logic Documentation:
Documented the logic behind the generation of reports in the Admission module. This includes criteria such as academic session, applicant category, admission status, and applied programs.
3.	Hostel Module - Direct Apply Configuration:
Added a configuration setting named &quot;Direct Apply&quot; in the Hostel module. When enabled, students can directly apply for hostel facilities by selecting only the academic session and room preference, simplifying the application process.
4.	Extended Applicant Report in Admission Module:
Enhanced the All Applicants Report in the Admission module to include additional details regarding:
a.	Hostel Facility: Shows whether the applicant has opted for hostel accommodation.
