Deep entity creation.␀Worked on attachment report observation done␀Working on SharePoint for SS2E + SS1E␀During the month, I successfully executed the payroll runs for LUAWMS, WUM, UOS, UOTN, and UOB for the periods of August and September. The process involved complete payroll execution, reconciliation of payroll results, and validation of employee-level wage type amounts to ensure accuracy before posting. Several issues were identified during reconciliation, including variances in payroll amounts and incorrect wage type postings. These were traced back to inconsistencies in GL account mappings and the bifurcation of payroll amounts between different cost centers and expense heads. Corrections were made to the payroll configuration, ensuring proper linkage of wage types to their respective GL accounts and cost allocations. Additionally, the payroll posting simulation and final postings were reviewed to confirm accurate reflection in the Finance (FI) module. Coordination with the university HR and Finance teams was also carried out to resolve posting errors and finalize payroll for the respective periods.␀1- Project Phase Details
