SLCM_Student Master Data Personal Data new fields_Global_KM␀Currently, multiple project activities are being handled across different phases and modules.
In one of the key project (SAC), we are in the Realize phase, where User Acceptance Testing (UAT) is actively in progress. This involves extensive user validation to ensure the system meets business requirements and is ready for deployment.
In parallel, we are also working closely with the client on ongoing follow-ups and coordination to ensure timely progress and issue resolution.
Additionally, for the GRC (Governance, Risk, and Compliance) &ndash; Process Control module, testing activities are being conducted to validate controls and system functionality.
For other projects, Hypercare support is ongoing, where we are managing post-go-live activities and providing continuous support to stabilize the system.
However, there are some delays in certain areas due to pending sign-offs. In some cases, stakeholders (including offshore teams) are not fully engaged, which is impacting progress. Despite this, we are actively following up, providing support, and driving efforts to complete pending activities and obtain necessary approvals.␀7th April

